                        "name":  "places/ChIJY4KDoKmpQjQR2RFjiDc6c2Y/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21GS05GRkJVa1YwTkc1MlN6WjRWM1JaZW1ZMVRVRRAB",
                        "relativePublishTimeDescription":  "4 months ago",
                        "rating":  5,
                        "text":  {
                                     "text":  "An outstanding example of Taiwanese street food done right. The gua bao here is beautifully balanced — soft, fluffy buns paired with richly braised pork that is flavorful without being greasy. The acidity and freshness from the garnishes lift the dish perfectly.\n\nWhat makes this place special is restraint. Nothing is overworked, nothing is exaggerated. It’s confident cooking rooted in tradition. Simple, direct, and incredibly satisfying. Easily one of the best gua bao experiences I’ve had, and absolutely worth a return visit.",
                                     "languageCode":  "en"
                                 },
                        "originalText":  {
