                        "rating":  4,
                        "text":  {
                                     "text":  "Michelin awarded pork buns. The pork is so tender, the Bao has a generous filling and a fair price. The taste is very much on the sweet side, I personally would have preferred a bit more balance, just a touch more salt and also acidity from the pickles. Sadly there is no way to adjust the taste, because the only condiment available is chili. Still an excellent quality Bao for a fair price - especially if you like it sweet.",
                                     "languageCode":  "en"
                                 },
